 colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"أسطورة لهذا التنسيق\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> الوثائق الخاصة بهذا التنسيق</a></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\"><hr/><p><b>Chinese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: 结构定义 Transaction</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana; vertical-align: top;\"><tr style=\"border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana; vertical-align: top\"><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"The logical name of the element\">Name</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Information about the use of the element\">Flags</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the element can appear in the instance\">Card.</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Reference to the type of the element\">Type</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Additional information about the element\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: white\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Transaction-definitions.html#Transaction\" title=\"A system-to-system technical exchange contract, extending the Interaction model. #xA;Adds the technical details needed to describe data exchanges between systems: exchange pattern, #xA;transport protocol, payload specifications, security requirements, and relationships to other #xA;transactions. This model is technology-agnostic — it can describe exchanges based on FHIR, #xA;HL7 v2, CDA, DICOM, X12, SOAP, or any other standard.\">Transaction</a><a name=\"zh-Transaction\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">0</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">..</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">*</span></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\">Interaction</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Transaction<br/><br/>Elements defined in Ancestors:<a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"Unique identifier(s) for this interaction definition.\">identifier</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"A short human-readable label for the interaction (e.g., 'Patient Demographics Query').\">name</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"A display title for the interaction.\">title</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"A human-readable description of what this interaction accomplishes.\">description</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The type of actors involved.\">type</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The publication status of this interaction definition.\">status</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The date this interaction definition was last changed.\">date</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"Why this interaction is defined — the business or clinical need it addresses.\">purpose</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The actor that triggers the interaction (logical source).\">initiator</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The actor that receives and responds to the interaction (logical endpoint).\">responder</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"Additional actors involved in the interaction beyond initiator and responder.\">participant</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"A description of the event or condition that initiates this interaction.\">trigger</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"Conditions that must be true before this interaction can occur.\">preCondition</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"Conditions that are expected to be true after this interaction completes successfully.\">postCondition</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The outbound payload — what the initiator supplies.\">request</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The return payload — what the responder returns. Absent for fire-and-forget patterns.\">response</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Interaction.html\" title=\"The processing semantics of the interaction — what actors do during the exchange, beyond what is expressed in pre/postConditions and the payload structure.\">semantics</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Transaction-definitions.html#Transaction.type\">type</a><a name=\"zh-Transaction.type\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">1</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">..</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">1</span></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a style=\"opacity: 0.5; opacity: 0.5\" href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\">code</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\">The type of actors involved.</span><br/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Required Pattern: </span><span style=\"color: darkgreen\">system-to-system</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: white\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Transaction-definitions.html#Transaction.request\">request</a><a name=\"zh-Transaction.request\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 soli